zyre
------------------------------------------
Zyre provides reliable group messaging over local area networks.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libczmq-devel-4.2.1-1bl3
  libczmq4-4.2.1-1bl3
  libzmq-devel-4.3.5-1
  libzmq5-4.3.5-1
  libzyre-devel-2.0.1-1bl2
  libzyre2-2.0.1-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  asciidoc-10.2.1-1
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libczmq-devel-4.2.1-1bl3
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libzmq-devel-4.3.5-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  xmlto-0.0.29-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/zeromq/zyre

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/zeromq/zyre/archive/refs/tags/v2.0.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack zyre-2.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./zyre-2.0.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/zyre-2.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/zyre-2.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libzyre2-2.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libzyre-devel-2.0.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(zyre)
  /usr/bin/zpinger.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/zyre.README
  /usr/share/doc/zyre/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/zyre/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/zyre/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/zyre/README.md
  /usr/share/man/man1/zpinger.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man7/zyre.7.gz
  /usr/share/zproject/zyre/python_cffi.slurp
  /usr/share/zproject/zyre/zyre.api
  /usr/share/zproject/zyre/zyre_event.api

(libzyre2)
  /usr/bin/cygzyre-2.dll

(libzyre-devel)
  /usr/include/zyre.h
  /usr/include/zyre_event.h
  /usr/include/zyre_library.h
  /usr/lib/libzyre.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libzyre.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/zyre.3.gz
  /usr/share/man/man3/zyre_event.3.gz

